I have a 20th level character at the Caveman Quest (chromatic dragon)
for the first time...  and this quest looks TOUGH.

I have an amulet of reflection, so I didn't think I had much to worry about
when I hopped down to take a look at the beast.

I walked into the lair and the dragon was asleep...  no problem.  I looked
at the objects in the room, and didn't see any sceptres (the quest item),
so I took one step into the room, and POW...  the dragon teleported to me,
whacked me three or four times and dropped me from 200+ HP to 100 or so...
I stepped back to the stairs and she whacked on me again and dropped me near
0.  I prayed to Anu and was healed... (whew), so I trotted up the stairs
thinking "wow...  glad I survived that one" and noticed she was still
standing next to me...  ARGH!  Luckily, I have a gazillion teleport wands
and a ring of teleport control.  I teleported from staircase to staircase
and finally got away from her.

Later (after recovering from the horror), I went back down (using the
same teleport technique to get past the dragon) and checked out the lair
more carefully....  no sceptres in that room, so I assume that I must kill
the dragon first.  But the question is HOW!?!?!?  I can't let her attack
me for more than 2 rounds, and she often follows me down/up the stairs.
The Main Caveman Dude tells me to use magic on her (which she herself
can't use)...  Is this referring to a wand of death?  She hasn't hit me
with a death ray yet...  (although she's disintegrated most of my armor).

So how do I deal with her???

Any advice would be greatly appreciated!

